{"inkVersion":21,"root":[["^Welcome to Sky Shooters! The only shooting gallery located in the stratosphere.","\n","^Gameplay is simple. Just grab a gun on that table over there with the LMB. Once you have a gun, you can toggle in and out AIMING with the RMB and FIRE with the LMB. You can only FIRE when you are AIMING.","\n","^Once you get a weapon, come talk to me again, and we'll get started.","\n","ev","str","^Continue","/str","/ev",{"*":"0.c-0","flg":4},{"c-0":[{"->":"selection"},"\n",{"->":"0.g-0"},{"#f":5}],"g-0":["done",{"#f":5}]}],"done",{"selection":[["^Once you start, a bunch of enemies will run out from behind the walls. The goal is to shoot as many of them as possible.","\n","^We have two levels:","\n","^Level A - Lots of enemies but they move pretty slow for the most part","\n","^Level B - Less enemies but they're much faster","\n","^The level will start as soon as you choose. Talk to me again if you want to reset or do a different level.","\n","ev","str","^Level A","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},"ev","str","^Level B","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":4},{"c-0":["^ ","done","\n",{"#f":5}],"c-1":["^ ","done","\n",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"#f":1}],"listDefs":{}}